<reference id="bacnet-BacnetPointDeviceExt" xml:lang="en" class="- topic/topic       reference/reference "><title class="- topic/title ">Points (bacnet-BacnetPointDeviceExt)</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">This container is the BACnet implementation of the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">PointDeviceExt</uicontrol>, a frozen container under every <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">BacnetDevice</uicontrol>.</shortdesc><prolog class="- topic/prolog "><metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">points<indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">container</indexterm></indexterm><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">Bacnet Point Device Ext</indexterm></keywords></metadata></prolog><refbody class="- topic/body        reference/refbody "><section class="- topic/section "><p class="- topic/p ">This component’s primary view is the <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Bacnet Point Manager</wintitle>. For information about the this view,
refer to <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Bacnet Point Manager</wintitle> topic in this guide.</p><p class="- topic/p ">To access this container, expand <menucascade class="+ topic/ph ui-d/menucascade "><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Config</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Drivers</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">BacnetNetwork</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">BacnetDevice</uicontrol></menucascade>, and double-click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Points</uicontrol>.</p><p class="- topic/p ">BACnet proxy points are similar to other
driver proxy points. Refer to the <cite class="- topic/cite "><ph conkeyref="doctitles_coresw/NiagaraDriversGuide" class="- topic/ph "/></cite> for general information.</p></section></refbody></reference>